///|
/// Whole-match results of compile-time `lexmatch` for 520 patterns on 24
/// inputs, most of them repeating a body that can match the empty string.
/// The runtime engine and compile-time `lexmatch` must agree; compile-time
/// `lexmatch` is the specification.
///
/// Each case is `(pattern, results)`. `results` has one entry per input in
/// `lexmatch_inputs`, separated by spaces: `before.length(),match.length()`,
/// or `-` when the catchall case ran. They were produced by compiling
///
/// ```mbt nocheck
/// lexmatch s { (re"PATTERN" as m, before=b, after=_) => ...; _ => ... }
/// ```
///
/// with moon 0.1.20261010. `scripts/generate_lexmatch_cases.py` in
/// https://github.com/bobzhang/tdfa regenerates the table.
